  "details": "1. Open VRChat on Steam Deck (I'm using OLED Model).\n\n2. Try to use the Quick Menu and Main Menu with the Track Pad.\n\nThere's a LOT of bugs with interacting with it. First off, you have to tap the Screen in order for the Right Trackpad to start working. Secondly, when clicking with Trigger, it stops working until you repeat the process. The ONLY WAY to interact with the Mouse is by using the L Joystick.\n\nThis needs WAY MORE TESTING! It's terrible that VRChat is Steam Deck Verified when the controllers are simply buggy!",
